00:55:48,888 --> 00:55:54,888
Logan is a 2017 American superhero film starring
Hugh Jackman as the titular character.

12
01:00:53,333 --> 01:00:59,333
Based on the Marvel Comics character Wolverine, the film was directed by James Mangold, who
co-wrote the screenplay with Michael Green and Scott Frank from a story by Mangold.

13
01:05:57,777 --> 01:06:03,777
It is the tenth in the X-Men film series and the third Wolverine solo film
following X-Men Origins: Wolverine (2009) and The Wolverine (2013).

14
01:11:02,222 --> 01:11:08,222
The film takes inspiration from  the "Old Man Logan" comics storyline by Mark Millar and Steve McNiven, follows an aged Wolverine and an
extremely ill Charles Xavier who must defend a young mutant named Laura from the Reavers led by Donald Pierce and Zander Rice.

15
01:16:06,666 --> 01:16:12,666
In addition to Jackman, the film also stars Patrick Stewart, Richard E.

16
01:21:11,111 --> 01:21:17,111
Grant, Boyd Holbrook, Stephen Merchant, and introduces
Dafne Keen in her film debut as Laura.

17
01:26:15,555 --> 01:26:21,555
Discussion for the film began following the release of The Wolverine in 2013, with Mangold in
negotiations to write the treatment for the film and Lauren Shuler Donner returning to produce.

18
01:31:20,000 --> 01:31:26,000
After updates followed that December to May 2016, principal photography began that May,
and ended that August, mainly in Louisiana, New Mexico, and Mississippi.

19
01:36:24,444 --> 01:36:30,444
The film was designed to look like it takes place in the near future, with slight updates to technology and
the social environment, with heavy influences from the Western genre, akin to a Neo-Western.

20
01:41:28,888 --> 01:41:34,888
Logan premiered at the 67th Berlin International Film Festival on February 17,
2017, and was theatrically released in the United States on March 3.

21
01:46:33,333 --> 01:46:39,333
It was praised by critics for its action scenes, emotional depth, performances, and
Mangold's direction, becoming the best-reviewed film in the X-Men franchise.

22
01:51:37,777 --> 01:51:43,777
The National Board of Review named Logan one of the top-ten films of 2017, and the film was also nominated for Best Adapted
Screenplay at the 90th Academy Awards, becoming the first live-action superhero film to be nominated for screenwriting.

23
01:56:42,222 --> 01:56:48,222
Grossing $619.2 million worldwide, it became the
third-highest-grossing R-rated film at its release.

24
02:01:46,666 --> 02:01:52,666
Jackman and Keen reprised their roles in the film Deadpool & Wolverine (2024).

25
02:06:51,111 --> 02:06:57,111
The film explores themes of future, experiment,
immortality, self-destruction, cyborg.

26
02:11:55,555 --> 02:12:01,555
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and emotional.
